<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00714">
	<title>Turning ON or OFF</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e04186">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e04187">
								<image href="images/N_SP327_D10_039_1_E.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>Press and hold the Parking Safety button (<image href="images/WKIA_087.jpg" scale="15" align="left" placement="inline"/>) for more than 2 seconds to turn the Parking Collision-Avoidance Assist <term translate="no">ON</term> or <term translate="no">OFF</term>.</p>
